  "body": "Stacked on #3990. This branch starts from `issue/1120-theme-colour-tokens` (the guard). Its own commits are 55001e555 (the change) and c8103e462 (the test move of the review). 5b2bc8a2a merges the #3990 review fix into this branch. Review those commits; the other commits are #3990. Merge #3990 first.\n\n## What changed\n\nThe first family of #1120: the viewport handle and pick inks.\n\n- Three colour tokens join `Tokens` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs`). Each is also a theme-file key (`colors.<name>`, `theme_files::COLOR_NAMES`):\n\n  | Token | Draws | Was |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | `handle_shade` | the shadow under a move or turn handle and under its readout | `Color32::from_black_alpha(170)` |\n  | `handle_text` | the readout text of a handle, and the fallback ink of an axis | `Color32::WHITE` |\n  | `pick_rim` | the rim of a picked point's disc | `Color32::from_rgb(245, 240, 250)` |\n\n- Both built-in tables (`theme/tables.rs`) carry the old values, so no pixel changes. The light table keeps the dark values: the handles and the picks draw over the 3D view, not over the chrome.\n- The draw sites read `theme::current()`: `egui_app/move_handles.rs`, `egui_app/turn_handles.rs`, `align_pick_viz.rs`.\n- The colour-literal guard (`crates/ui/tests/theme_files/colour_literals.rs`) loses the rows of those three files. The row of `theme/tables.rs` goes from 32 to 38 (3 tokens in 2 tables).\n- Wiring of the new keys: `theme_files/names.rs`, `theme_files/overlay.rs`, `assets/themes/theme.json.example`, and the colour table of `docs/user-guide/themes.md`.\n- `geom_legal` and its two const asserts move unchanged from `theme.rs` (425 lines) to the new `theme/legal.rs`. `theme.rs` is now 318 lines.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/1120-handle-inks.md` (flat names, the light column, what was dropped).\n\n## Pinning tests\n\nBoth in `crates/ui/tests/theme_files/viewport_inks.rs`, a module of the existing `theme_files` test binary (#3187: no new binary):\n\n- `theme_files::viewport_inks::the_built_in_columns_keep_the_handle_and_pick_colours`: both columns carry the old literals.\n- `theme_files::viewport_inks::a_theme_file_sets_each_handle_and_pick_ink_by_name`: a theme file sets the three keys, with no \"unknown key\" note.\n- `theme_example::example_has_exactly_the_loader_keys`: the example file has the three new keys.\n- `theme_files::colour_literals::no_colour_literal_outside_the_allowed_rows`: the three files have no colour literal left.\n\n## Gates\n\nOn the head c8103e462:\n\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): 10 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (3.2 min). It includes `ui suites: lib`, `ui suites: theme_example` and `ui suites: theme_files` (24 tests).\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-ui -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: the diff reaches none (`cargo xtask gate heavy --dry-run`: 0 steps reached).\n\n## Screenshots\n\nMove mode on the demo Block (move arrows, turn rings, axis balls, view cube), and two picked points on the Setup page (the pick rim). Dark and light theme. The images come from the off-screen renderer (`egui_kittest` with the headless wgpu device, as in `guide_images`), on the demo Block at 1280 x 720. The images are on the images-only `pr-screenshots` branch of the fork, not on this branch.\n\nThe before and after images are identical: a pixel comparison of each pair gives 0 different pixels.\n\n| | Before (`main` pixels, at e4b71bb0d) | After (c8103e462) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Handles, dark | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/before-handles-dark.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/after-handles-dark.png) |\n| Handles, light | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/before-handles-light.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/after-handles-light.png) |\n| Picks, dark | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/before-picks-dark.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/after-picks-dark.png) |\n| Picks, light | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/before-picks-light.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3992/after-picks-light.png) |\n\nThe handle readout (`handle_text`) shows only during a drag, so these images do not show it. The test pins its value.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No check by hand in the GUI. The values are the old ones; the test and the pixel comparison pin them.\n- The shipped themes `teal-night.json` and `horizon-day.json` do not set the new keys. They take the values of their base table, as before.\n\nChangelog: Themes can set the viewport handle shadow, the handle readout text and the rim of a picked point (`handle_shade`, `handle_text`, `pick_rim`).\n\nRefs #1120\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
